{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9bba8b63fa8ca322896834198c2120ba7f1436f5c7c606ec09123ff64a439e43", "ja": "（今日はバレンタインPVの撮影だが、美希の調子が\nいい。おかげで、前半はかなりスムーズに進んだな！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄情人节PV，不过美希状态很好。多亏了她，前半部分进行得相当顺利啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "90cb8c28c2021443b777d465c02643c0a10ccba0a2ac96b1ef1194076ca27709", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様なの♪\nミキのこと、ちゃんと見ててくれた？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦♪有好好看着美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "132f2c952c32e4a093740c1c6aeeb8a7cf96087f16d1e3c47db7b7f99c47cdb0", "ja": "ああ、すごく良かったぞ！　甘い表情も仕草も\n全部が魅力的で、ずっと目が離せなかったよ。", "zh": "啊，非常棒！甜美的表情和动作，全都很有魅力，让我一直移不开视线。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "97ac69f42800795c8d75559e46f1f2055b4386000f7596d286556482d291bb27", "ja": "ホント！？\nじゃあ、大成功なの♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n那就是大成功啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f28c137a00ace8e2695dcecdc05d5752517a9b82ef2417be53784e4096531243", "ja": "何か演技のコツとかあるのか？\nもしあるなら、聞いておきたいんだけど。", "zh": "有什么演技的诀窍吗？\n如果有的话，我想先听听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "d8453bcb1da55000b87505a647b7ec23e9b0c8db1e116ba3f7aed1b0646821c0", "ja": "ないよ？　なんとなくってカンジ。", "zh": "没有哦？就是凭感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5c36b338ceb5674bf025a0f56021c025bf173e47c643847d524e1794b29390c8", "ja": "なるほど。いつもながら、\n返事は明快だな……コツは曖昧だけど……。", "zh": "原来如此。还是一如既往，回答很明确啊……不过诀窍倒是说得很含糊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "55b24145bdd19e3551c5add830cce50514845284a5abddf3ea1ada477533995b", "ja": "あ、でも今日は、いつもよりいっぱい、\nハニーのことを考えてたかも♪", "zh": "啊，不过今天好像比平时更多地想着亲爱的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "0740a3893cb00727a60bf3133f63505b453656e5423df84fce9d4b69727df1e2", "ja": "だって今日は、\nバレンタインの撮影でしょ？　だから～。", "zh": "因为今天要拍情人节的照片，对吧？所以嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "672f046a2711404c05e8978ab97fbb95995f2d28453368d5c509290b09a4e2e6", "ja": "ミキ、ずーっと考えてたの。ハニーにチョコ\n渡すときのこととか……その後のこととか♪", "zh": "美希一直在想呢。比如要给亲爱的送巧克力的时候……还有之后的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5a130edaff48d2082573ae1fe53bf1989ce4c4dddd5e67b20967c124a4d7fad5", "ja": "そ、そうか……。その後のこととかはともかく、\nそれじゃ、他の子の参考にはならなそうだな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……。先不说之后的事，\n看来没法给其他女孩参考了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "7594edaee4167bdc67b2b7cecb85004efcd84c110dbab029a55f959ddfbc7008", "ja": "そう？　そうでもないって思うな。", "zh": "是吗？我觉得也不一定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1012_p", "source_sha256": "91abf26ac5374c6189dda7c3123d15a4852c457247a71b9fec69d519bfedd058", "ja": "え？　ああ、みんなそれぞれ、チョコを渡す相手の\nことを考えれば……って、みんな誰かいるのか？", "zh": "诶？啊，只要大家各自想想要送巧克力的对象……等等，难道大家都有对象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "193ea4089a1606dc2f7c9bed937157c93e3e56d50e1b05ea057188ccad7c8151", "ja": "む～。知らないの。\nみんなに聞いてみれば？", "zh": "唔～。我不知道啦。\n你去问问大家不就好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "2feb875f2a0c2095e1cb630f89d4d197cf69c3cdd852d6a1be087b4492995e04", "ja": "でも、今はダメ！　ミキとのお仕事中でしょ？\nミキのことだけ考えて？", "zh": "但是现在不行！你不是正在和美希一起工作吗？只想着美希，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "b53b074798af58159940d334addea42cf2c14ba5e7b760e8016751268786a918", "ja": "ミキと一緒なのに、他のコのことなんか考えたら……\nミキ、帰るっ！", "zh": "明明和美希在一起，却还想着别的女孩子的话……美希要回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8db2d1f633fe5b303621c26995087a94f24f7ffce356f017a81884dfdb0f0dd1", "ja": "わ、わかった！　もちろん、今は美希のことだけ\n考えるよ。後半の撮影も目を離さない！", "zh": "好、好，我知道了！当然，现在只想着美希。\n后半段的拍摄也会一直盯着你，不会移开视线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "75cd8c1f524b1e981f0558542e3ea7333bdaaca92a7d71f6bf94a95998d6a237", "ja": "……あはっ、だったら許してあげる♪\n後半もいっぱい、ハニーのこと考えるね☆", "zh": "……啊哈，那美希就原谅你啦♪\n后半段美希也会一直想着Honey的哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0164_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "dc90ab72dacdccf5b684962268acf63c649e8c1f31ce9a6fe9d79677a2dd200c", "ja": "チョコ渡すときのこととか、その後のこととか……\n将来のこととか♪　あはっ☆", "zh": "比如送巧克力的时候，还有送完之后的事……\n还有将来的事♪ 啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
